<TeXmacs|2.1.5>

<style|article>

<\body>
  <section|Chinese, Japanese and Korean>

  Chinese text in the default font, whose ideographs come from a system
  font found by the font fallback (on macOS, Songti):

  <\with|language|chinese>
    \<#4E2D\>\<#6587\>\<#6392\>\<#7248\>\<#5141\>\<#8BB8\>\<#5728\>\<#4EFB\>\<#610F\>\<#4E24\>\<#4E2A\>\<#6C49\>\<#5B57\>\<#4E4B\>\<#95F4\>\<#65AD\>\<#884C\>\<#FF0C\>\<#4F46\>\<#53E5\>\<#53F7\>\<#3001\>\<#9017\>\<#53F7\>\<#7B49\>\<#6807\>\<#70B9\>\<#4E0D\>\<#80FD\>\<#51FA\>\<#73B0\>\<#5728\>\<#884C\>\<#9996\>\<#3002\>\<#8FD9\>\<#4E00\>\<#6BB5\>\<#6587\>\<#5B57\>\<#8DB3\>\<#591F\>\<#957F\>\<#FF0C\>\<#53EF\>\<#4EE5\>\<#6392\>\<#6210\>\<#597D\>\<#51E0\>\<#884C\>\<#FF0C\>\<#7528\>\<#6765\>\<#68C0\>\<#67E5\>\<#65AD\>\<#884C\>\<#7684\>\<#89C4\>\<#5219\>\<#3002\>
  </with>

  Japanese text in the Hiragino Kaku font of the Document<nbsp>\<gtr\>
  Font menu, with kanji, hiragana and katakana:

  <\with|language|japanese|font|kaku>
    \<#65E5\>\<#672C\>\<#8A9E\>\<#306E\>\<#6587\>\<#7AE0\>\<#306F\>\<#3001\>\<#6F22\>\<#5B57\>\<#3068\>\<#3072\>\<#3089\>\<#304C\>\<#306A\>\<#3068\>\<#30AB\>\<#30BF\>\<#30AB\>\<#30CA\>\<#3092\>\<#6DF7\>\<#305C\>\<#3066\>\<#66F8\>\<#304D\>\<#307E\>\<#3059\>\<#3002\>\<#30C6\>\<#30AD\>\<#30B9\>\<#30C8\>\<#304C\>\<#9577\>\<#304F\>\<#306A\>\<#308B\>\<#3068\>\<#3001\>\<#884C\>\<#306E\>\<#7D42\>\<#308F\>\<#308A\>\<#3067\>\<#81EA\>\<#52D5\>\<#7684\>\<#306B\>\<#6539\>\<#884C\>\<#3055\>\<#308C\>\<#307E\>\<#3059\>\<#3002\>
  </with>

  Korean text in the Gothic font (AppleGothic) of the same menu:

  <\with|language|korean|font|apple-gothic>
    \<#D55C\>\<#AD6D\>\<#C5B4\> \<#BB38\>\<#C7A5\>\<#C785\>\<#B2C8\>\<#B2E4\>.
  </with>

  Ideographs may also occur in a Latin paragraph, as in
  \<#4E2D\>\<#6587\> (Chinese) and \<#65E5\>\<#672C\> (Japan).
</body>

